  "definition": "Nutrition Services: Home-Delivered Meals",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-03-19",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for He-E 502) #10530, eff 2-28-14; ss by #13354, eff 3-19-22 (formerly He-E 502.30)",
